# Git

Take a verified change through git using the `git-workflow` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/git-workflow/SKILL.md` and `commands/git.md`.

## Usage
```
/git status
/git branch --task "add ImpactInvestment to the donation form"
/git pr --title "Add ImpactInvestment to the donation flow"
```

## Output
The branch, the commit sha and the pull-request URL — or, below autonomy level 4, those
same artifacts handed to a human to execute.

## Notes
Branch and commit need level 2; push and PR need level 4. There is no merge step at any
level: merging is the last place a person is still required to look.
